    "53_2021_L": "Bill No. 53-F of  2021\nTHE APPROPRIATION (NO. 2) BILL, 2021\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT—\nLOK SABHA ON 17 MARCH, 2021\nRAJYA SABHA ON 23 MARCH, 2021)\nASSENTED  TO\n ON 25 MAR, 2021\nACT NO. 7 OF 2021\n\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2) BILL, 2021\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT)\nA\nBILL\nto authorise payment and appropriation of certain sums from and out of the Consolidated\nFund of India for the services of the financial year 2021-22.\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the Seventy-second Y ear of the Republic of India as\nfollows:—\n1. This Act may be called the Appropriation (No.  2) Act, 2021.\n2. From and out of the Consolidated Fund of India there may be paid and applied\nsums not exceeding those specified in column 3 of the Schedule amounting in the aggregate\nto the sum of  one hundred seventeen lakh sixteen thousand seven hundred eleven crore and\nthirty-five lakh rupees towards defraying the several charges which will come in course of\npayment during the financial year 2021-22 in respect of the services specified in column 2 of\nthe Schedule.\n3. The sums authorised to be paid and applied from and out of the Consolidated Fund\nof India  by this Act shall be appropriated for the services and purposes expressed in the\nSchedule in relation to the said year.\n4. Reference to the Ministries  or  Departments  in  the Schedule  are  to such Ministries\nor Departments as existing immediately before the 18\nth  January, 2021 and shall, on or after\nthat date, be construed as references to the appropriate Ministries or Departments as\nconstituted from time to time.\nShort title.\nAppropriation.\nIssue of Rs.\n11716711,35,00,000\nout of the\nConsolidated\nFund of India\nfor the\nfinancial year\n2021-22.\nConstruction\nof references\nto Ministries or\nDepartments in\nthe Schedule.\nBill No. 53-F of 2021\n\n2\nTHE  SCHEDULE\n(See sections 2, 3 and 4)\n   1                                                              2 3\nNo.             